       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DIVIDEREMAINDER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 DIVIDEND   PIC 9(4) VALUE 1234.
       01 DIVISOR    PIC 9(2) VALUE 7.
       01 QUOTIENT   PIC 9(4).
       01 REMAINDER-V PIC 9(2).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DIVIDE DIVIDEND BY DIVISOR GIVING QUOTIENT
               REMAINDER REMAINDER-V
           DISPLAY DIVIDEND " / " DIVISOR " = " QUOTIENT
                   " REMAINDER " REMAINDER-V
           STOP RUN.
